# hprc30: CHM13, GRCh38 and both haplotypes of 14 HPRC release-2 samples, HG002 among them: the inputs of the
# HPRC v2.1 graph for these samples.  GRCh38 is v2.1's: the no-alt analysis set cut down to chr1-22, X, Y and M.
# The maternal (.2) haplotypes of the 13 non-HG002 samples are v1.2.0 in v2.1, which is v1.0.1 with its
# mitochondrion replaced by GenBank's corrected (.2) record.  v1.2.0 has no public copy, so the URLs below are
# v1.0.1's, and the suite makes v1.2.0 from them (MITO in hprc30.py).  Used as it is, this seqfile differs from
# v2.1's inputs only in those 13 mitochondria.
CHM13	https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/human-pangenomics/working/HPRC_PLUS/CHM13/assemblies/analysis_set/pansn/chm13v2.0_maskedY_rCRS.fa.PanSN.fa.gz
